WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 28 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.880
Sylvia, can we talk? Just five minutes.

2
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.880
We have nothing to talk about.

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:16.820
Seeing you tonight made me realize just how badly I was wrong.

4
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:21.710
I know we can't go back to how things were, but...

5
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.710
I just want to have one last drink with you.

6
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:29.310
To say goodbye to what we once had.

7
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.310
Fine.

8
00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.310
Five minutes.

9
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:51.840
Sylvia, a toast to our past engagement.

10
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.840
From this day on, I wish you happiness.

11
00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:00.100
How does it taste, my beautiful Sylvia?

12
00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.710
What did you put in the drink? My body feels so hot.

13
00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:14.710
Just something to make sure you'll never leave me.

14
00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:22.070
Did you really think you could escape me? You're going to be mine.

15
00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:24.610
All of me!

16
00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:34.040
Stop resisting. You drank an aphrodisiac. Only my body can cure you.

17
00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:39.740
Crisis detected. Would you like to exchange affinity points for...

18
00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.740
Help me! Use whatever it takes!

19
00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.740
Reflection skill exchanged successfully.

20
00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:51.740
Would you like to activate the skill and reflect the aphrodisiac onto the target? Lorenzo?

21
00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:52.740
Activate it.

22
00:01:52.740 --> 00:02:07.080
You dare kick me? You should have already lost all your strength.

23
00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:16.310
So hot and burning up.
